"Open SpaceMonger and pick what to scan:\n\n• Choose a disk from the list, or click “Scan a Folder…” to pick any folder.\n• Recently scanned places appear under “Recent” for one-click rescanning.\n\nEach disk shows how much space is used and free, and its file system." = "打开 SpaceMonger，选择要扫描的内容：\n\n• 从列表中选择一个磁盘，或点按“扫描文件夹…”选择任意文件夹。\n• 最近扫描过的位置会显示在“最近”下，可一键重新扫描。\n\n每个磁盘都会显示已用和可用空间，以及其文件系统。";
"Scanning runs in the background and shows live progress. Press Cancel any time.\n\nSizes are the space items actually take on disk, like the Finder. Symbolic links aren’t followed and other mounted volumes aren’t crossed, so totals stay accurate.\n\nUse the refresh button to rescan." = "扫描在后台运行并实时显示进度。可随时点按“取消”。\n\n大小是项目在磁盘上实际占用的空间，与访达一致。不跟随符号链接，也不跨越其他已挂载的宗卷，因此总计保持准确。\n\n使用刷新按钮重新扫描。";
"The map shows where your space goes. Each item’s size is proportional to its share of the disk.\n\n• Sunburst: rings radiate from the focused folder outward into subfolders.\n• Treemap: nested rectangles. Switch layouts from the toolbar.\n\nHover an item to highlight it and see its size in the centre. Use the colour menu to colour By Folder, By File Type or By Depth." = "图表显示空间的去向。每个项目的大小与其在磁盘中的占比成正比。\n\n• 旭日图：从聚焦的文件夹向外辐射到子文件夹的环。\n• 矩形树图：嵌套的矩形。可在工具栏切换布局。\n\n将指针悬停在项目上以高亮显示并在中心查看其大小。使用颜色菜单：按文件夹、按文件类型或按深度。";
"• Double-click an item (or a row in the list) to zoom into a folder.\n• Click the centre of the sunburst — or double-click empty space in the treemap — to go up one level.\n• Use the breadcrumb at the top to jump to any level." = "• 双击某个项目（或列表中的一行）以进入文件夹。\n• 点按旭日图中心——或双击矩形树图中的空白处——可上移一级。\n• 使用顶部的路径栏跳转到任意层级。";
"Click an item to select it. The panel on the right shows its size, share of the folder and of the whole disk, item count and path.\n\nThe list below ranks the current folder by size; type in the Filter field to narrow it.\n\nActions (panel, context menu or menu bar): Quick Look (Space or ⌘Y), Open, Open With, Reveal in Finder, Copy Path." = "点按某个项目以选择它。右侧面板显示其大小、占该文件夹和整个磁盘的比例、项目数量和路径。\n\n下方列表按大小对当前文件夹排序；在“筛选”栏中输入以缩小范围。\n\n操作（面板、快捷菜单或菜单栏）：快速查看（空格或 ⌘Y）、打开、打开方式、在访达中显示、拷贝路径。";
"Gather things you might delete in the Collector, then remove them together:\n\n• Drag items onto the Collector, or use “Add to Collector”.\n• Press “Move to Trash” to delete everything in it at once.\n\nDeletions always go to the Trash, so you can recover them. Safety stoppers refuse to delete system-critical files and whole volumes." = "在收集箱中收集可能要删除的内容，然后一起移除：\n\n• 将项目拖到收集箱，或使用“加入收集箱”。\n• 点按“移到废纸篓”以一次性删除其中全部内容。\n\n删除的项目始终进入废纸篓，因此可以恢复。安全限制会拒绝删除系统关键文件和整个宗卷。";
"“System & hidden space” is disk usage that couldn’t be attributed to readable files.\n\n• Grant Full Disk Access (the banner links to Settings) so system folders can be read.\n• Or use Rescan as Administrator to measure root-only files.\n• Open “Manage snapshots & purgeable space” to delete local Time Machine snapshots and reclaim purgeable space." = "“系统与隐藏空间”是无法归属到可读文件的磁盘占用。\n\n• 授予“完全磁盘访问权限”（横幅会链接到设置），以便读取系统文件夹。\n• 或使用“以管理员身份重新扫描”来测量仅 root 可读的文件。\n• 打开“管理快照与可清除空间”以删除本地时间机器快照并回收可清除空间。";
"Focus highlights just the files you care about. Open the focus button in the toolbar and filter by name, type or minimum size; matching files stay bright while the rest dim and the list narrows.\n\nExclusions (Settings, ⌘,) skip items by name pattern while scanning, e.g. node_modules or *.log." = "聚焦只会高亮你关心的文件。打开工具栏中的聚焦按钮，按名称、类型或最小大小筛选；匹配的文件保持明亮，其余变暗，列表随之缩小。\n\n排除项（设置，⌘,）在扫描时按名称模式跳过项目，例如 node_modules 或 *.log。";
"• Save Scan… (⌘S) writes the current scan to a .smscan file.\n• Open Scan… (⇧⌘O) re-opens it; .gpscan files can also be imported.\n• Compare with Saved Scan… diffs the current scan against a saved one and lists what grew, shrank, was added or removed." = "• 存储扫描…（⌘S）将当前扫描写入 .smscan 文件。\n• 打开扫描…（⇧⌘O）重新打开它；也可导入 .gpscan 文件。\n• 与已存储的扫描比较…将当前扫描与已存储的进行对比，列出增大、减小、新增或移除的内容。";
"⌘O Scan a folder · ⌘R Rescan · ⌥⌘R Rescan as administrator\n⌘S Save scan · ⇧⌘O Open scan\nSpace or ⌘Y Quick Look · ⇧⌘R Reveal · ⇧⌘C Copy path\n⌘D Add to Collector · ⌘⌫ Move to Trash · ⌘, Settings" = "⌘O 扫描文件夹 · ⌘R 重新扫描 · ⌥⌘R 以管理员身份重新扫描\n⌘S 存储扫描 · ⇧⌘O 打开扫描\n空格或 ⌘Y 快速查看 · ⇧⌘R 显示 · ⇧⌘C 拷贝路径\n⌘D 加入收集箱 · ⌘⌫ 移到废纸篓 · ⌘, 设置";
